{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","蛇灵祭礼"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Spiritual Viper"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","牺牲生命值使敌人被“冥蛇”附身，并能对这些敌人造成大量伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Viperian burns HP and sends Darkvipers to possess the enemies, dealing massive damage."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，维珀里安会尽可能消耗自身生命值派出“冥蛇”附身所有敌人直至自身生命值不足60%，每派出一条“冥蛇”消耗自身7%最大生命值，在此期间处于霸体状态。每一个被“冥蛇”附身的敌人降低20点受击回能，同时需要自身每秒支付1% HP的生命值维持“冥蛇”的附身。当自身生命值低于30%时，召回一条“冥蛇”使自己回复14% HP的生命值。主动释放时，对所有被“冥蛇”附身的单位造成280% + 20% ATK伤害。若场上没有敌人被“冥蛇”附身，则会对当前目标造成伤害，并使最近的敌人被“冥蛇”附身。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. Viperian burns HP as much as possible when a battle starts, sending Darkvipers to possess all enemies until his HP is below 60%. During this skill, he is unaffected while losing 7% max HP for each Darkviper deployed. Every possessed enemy drops 20 Energy on Hit, losing 1% HP HP per second to sustain the survivability of the Darkviper on them. Viperian calls a Darkviper back to recover 14% HP HP when his HP ratio is below 30%.\nActive. Viperian deals 280% + 20% ATK damage to all possessed enemies. He inflicts the nearest enemy with the same effect and Darkviper possession if no enemy on the battlefield is possessed."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":192,"end":198,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":466,"end":472,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":73,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":111,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":156,"end":162,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":188,"end":202,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":163,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":279,"end":284,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":397,"end":403,"too