% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 320% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","生机吮噬"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Soul Ravager"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","抽取最健康的敌人生命值。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Viperian drains HP from the healthiest enemy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","抽取最健康的敌人生命，造成210% + 25% ATK伤害，并回复等量生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Viperian drains HP from the healthiest enemy, dealing 210% + 25% ATK damage and recovering HP that equals the damage dealt."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:strongest"},{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":28,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"keyword:strongest"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 220% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 230% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 240% + 25% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","附灵吸髓"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Enchantment Fang"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","“冥蛇”会定期进行撕咬，造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Darkvipers launch Tearing Bite periodically to deal damage."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗过程中每过3秒，“冥蛇”会进行一次撕咬，对所有被“冥蛇”附身的敌人造成一次65% ATK伤害。主动释放时，牺牲10%最大生命值使得下一次撕咬获得强化，造成140% ATK伤害，并扣除目标60 + 15点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. Darkvipers launch Tearing Bite once every 3s during the battle, dealing 65% ATK damage once to all the possessed enemies. \nActive. Viperian burns 10% max HP to enhance the next Tearing Bite, dealing 140% ATK damage to the target and reducing their Energy by 60 + 15."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":98,"end":103,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":269,"end":274,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":80,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":81,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":208,"end":216,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通撕咬的伤害提升至75% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Common Tearing Bite damage to 75% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":40,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强化撕咬的伤害提升至150% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Enhanced Tearing Bite damage to 150% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":42,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","扣除目标100 + 15点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces the target's Energy by 100 + 15."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Haste during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 12 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 20 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","血祭蛇舞"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Crimson Waltz"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","当生命值较高时，会牺牲生命值对全体敌人造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Burns HP to deal massive damage to all enemies when having a higher HP portion."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始10秒后，若当前生命值比例大于90%，牺牲30% HP生命值，对全体敌人造成420% ATK伤害，施法期间处于霸体状态。该技能在30秒内至多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Viperian burns 30% HP HP 10s into a battle if his HP ratio is above 90%, dealing 420% ATK damage to all enemies. He is unaffected during the skill casting. This skill can be triggered once every 30s."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":42,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":15,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":81,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":119,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至450% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 450% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能释放后“冥蛇”们获得2次强化。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Darkvipers gain 2 enhancements after the skill is cast."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 480% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“蛇灵祭礼”派出的“冥蛇”附身的敌人被击败时，“冥蛇”会返回自身，并回复生命值和能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Darkvipers return when the possessed enemies are defeated, recovering HP and Energy for Viperian."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“蛇灵祭礼”派出的“冥蛇”所附身的敌人被击败时，“冥蛇”会返回自身，并回复14% HP的生命值和80点能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Darkvipers return when the possessed enemies are defeated, recovering 14% HP HP and 80 Energy for Viperian."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":70,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“冥蛇”造成的伤害将附带10点生命汲取。每有一名敌人生命值百分比首次低于60%时，可额外派出一条“冥蛇”，优先选择未被“冥蛇”附身或当前造成伤害最高的敌人，每名敌人至多被2条“冥蛇”附身。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Damage dealt by Darkvipers benefits from 10 extra Life Drain. The first time an enemy's HP percentage falls below 60%, Viperian sends out an extra Darkviper, prioritizing enemies who are not already possessed by a Darkviper, or who have dealt the most damage. Each enemy can be possessed by up to 2 Darkvipers at the same time."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","附灵蛇骸"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Enchanted Slough"]]}